    <decisions>
        <description>checks to see if the user filled out Condition Description and Condition Deadline in the first screen</description>
        <name>Conditional_Fields_Blank</name>
        <label>Conditional Fields Blank?</label>
        <locationX>572</locationX>
        <locationY>758</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>NO</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>YES_condition_fields_blank</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND (2 OR 3)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>singleGiftTransaction.Transaction_Conditional__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Yes</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>singleGiftTransaction.Condition_Description__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>singleGiftTransaction.Condition_Deadline__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>TransactionConditionalMessage</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>YES</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>V8 [Arkus/Becky 9-30-25] removed Condition Met fields from the first screen. Also, added custom error message explaining that Condition Description and Condition Deadline are required when Transaction Conditional? is Yes. 

[DJS - 9-25-2025] Added back Condition Description (as regular text) and made Conditional y/n required 

[DJS - 9-22-2025] Reverted back to this one without being able to modify the repeater to re-apply the Gift Transaction Condition Description. This field was removed to modify the field type. 

[Arkus/BL 4-18-25] Screen flow runs from a button on Gift Commitment. Allows the user to enter multiple Gift Transactions, and the flow creates them all at once. Added Id variable for the Gift Commtiment.</description>
